<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="iH9od" id="iH9od" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub8a8d1be" id="ub8a8d1be">🚀</span><span data-lake-id="u016ebd21" id="u016ebd21"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufbd84326" id="ufbd84326">𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐢𝐧 𝐨𝐟 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: 𝐈𝐦𝐩𝐫𝐨𝐯𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐢𝐧-𝐨𝐟-𝐓𝐡𝐨𝐮𝐠𝐡𝐭 𝐑𝐞𝐚𝐬𝐨𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐢𝐧 𝐋𝐋𝐌𝐬</span></strong></h1><p data-lake-id="u1df2437b" id="u1df2437b"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud645956f" id="ud645956f">大语言模型的最新研究进展表明，构建推理链对于提升其问题求解能力至关重要。一种具有代表性的方法是思维链，该方法通过提示引导大语言模型生成中间推理步骤，即思维单元，从而构建显式的推理路径</span></strong></p><ul list="uf7462b72"><li fid="ua058afc3" data-lake-id="u9636aef9" id="u9636aef9"><span data-lake-id="u1e412d6b" id="u1e412d6b">尽管这一方法简单直观，但近期研究发现，由于仅关注单条路径，CoT 往往会忽略最优推理路径，并表现出缺乏审慎思考的作答方式</span></li><li fid="ua058afc3" data-lake-id="u201031bf" id="u201031bf"><span data-lake-id="u6fc945ca" id="u6fc945ca">为促使模型采用更为审慎且有意识的推理方式，Yao 等人提出思维树。该方法在推理过程的每一步生成多个分支思维单元，并通过自我评估进行剪枝和规划，以搜索推理路径</span></li><li fid="ua058afc3" data-lake-id="ufa113d9f" id="ufa113d9f"><strong><span data-lake-id="ued34f7a1" id="ued34f7a1" style="color: #5C0036">然而，ToT 在提升推理质量的同时，也显著增加计算复杂度，限制其实际应用。这引出一个问题：能否将 ToT 所具备的深层策略性推理能力融入 CoT，在保持效率的同时提升其效果？</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uba142050" id="uba142050"><span data-lake-id="u84e0c536" id="u84e0c536">一种自然的策略是，将 ToT 为每个样本搜索得到的推理路径作为监督目标，随后微调大语言模型，以提升其 CoT 推理能力。已有多种方法尝试改进这一策略，包括采用蒙特卡洛树搜索等先进的树搜索技术，以及利用外部奖励模型进行剪枝和规划，从而获得更优的推理路径作为监督信号</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6e8b05de" id="u6e8b05de"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud63104d9" id="ud63104d9">本文指出上述方法的一项局限：它们忽略树搜索过程中生成的非最优思维单元，而这些思维单元天然蕴含额外的偏好信息</span></strong></p><ul list="u5c5a3abf"><li fid="u8cb49cd1" data-lake-id="ua2f2c24d" id="ua2f2c24d"><span data-lake-id="u23c272aa" id="u23c272aa">具体而言，ToT 在每个推理步骤中都会生成多个候选思维单元，并根据对其质量的评估结果进行剪枝。这一树搜索过程在所有候选中间思维单元之间形成偏好关系：相较于未出现在搜索所得最优推理路径中的思维单元，出现在该路径中的思维单元更受偏好</span></li><li fid="u8cb49cd1" data-lake-id="u9f9ec36e" id="u9f9ec36e"><span data-lake-id="ua4fd8e93" id="ua4fd8e93">此外，这类信息甚至能够提供比最终找到的最优推理路径更丰富的启示，因为树搜索的每一步都存在非最优推理路径，因而也蕴含相应的偏好关系</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udfdaf036" id="udfdaf036"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf43bc905" id="uf43bc905">受直接偏好优化等相关技术启发，提出链式偏好优化（Chain-of-Preference Optimization，CPO），以充分利用上述内在偏好信息</span></strong></p><ul list="u48758d11"><li fid="u1cfa3d70" data-lake-id="u42977085" id="u42977085"><span data-lake-id="u02ddfe36" id="u02ddfe36">具体而言，根据 ToT 的搜索树，在每个推理步骤中构建成对的思维偏好数据，随后采用 DPO 算法训练大语言模型，使其与这些偏好对齐</span></li><li fid="u1cfa3d70" data-lake-id="u7162b7e8" id="u7162b7e8"><span data-lake-id="ubf3b0a7c" id="ubf3b0a7c">思维偏好对的构建遵循上述直觉：在每个推理步骤中，根据思维单元是否包含在 ToT 最终选定的路径中，将其划分为优选思维单元和非优选思维单元。借助这些偏好数据，CPO 使大语言模型能够在推理阶段通过 CoT 解码生成 ToT 所偏好的路径</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6afe2819" id="u6afe2819" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791002927738-868c71da-77a5-42b8-a9bf-e68436f0fcc5.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubc736cb0-932d-4c4c-86dc-c2a79a0698c%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uaa46dc12-15d5-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A715.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A322%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A206941%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1097%2C%22originHeight%22%3A494%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22(C)CHAINOFPREFERENCEOPTIMIZATION(CPO)%22%2C%22x%22%3A615%2C%22y%22%3A30%2C%22width%22%3A353%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THROUGHTOTANDTHENTUNINGLLMVIADPO.%22%2C%22x%22%3A501%2C%22y%22%3A449%2C%22width%22%3A331%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COLLECTINGPREFFERENCEDATA(OFEACHSTEP)%22%2C%22x%22%3A499%2C%22y%22%3A426%2C%22width%22%3A319%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SELECTEDTHOUGHTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A66%2C%22y%22%3A428%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(BTREEOFTHOUGHTIOT%22%2C%22x%22%3A212%2C%22y%22%3A31%2C%22width%22%3A212%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PREFERENCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A761%2C%22y%22%3A325%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THOUGHT(COT%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A40%2C%22width%22%3A122%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A257%2C%22y%22%3A386%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PRUNEDTHOUGHTS.%22%2C%22x%22%3A63%2C%22y%22%3A454%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(ACHAINOF%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMEASCO.%22%2C%22x%22%3A976%2C%22y%22%3A452%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRAINING.%22%2C%22x%22%3A357%2C%22y%22%3A428%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A571%2C%22y%22%3A397%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNFERENCE.%22%2C%22x%22%3A352%2C%22y%22%3A453%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%9D%A2%3E%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22x%22%3A754%2C%22y%22%3A130%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A986%2C%22y%22%3A390%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A59%2C%22y%22%3A389%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%80%8C%22%2C%22x%22%3A746%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NFERENCE%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A977%2C%22y%22%3A427%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A284%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DATA%22%2C%22x%22%3A783%2C%22y%22%3A349%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DPO%22%2C%22x%22%3A911%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A989%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A609%2C%22y%22%3A90%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A90%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A464%2C%22y%22%3A384%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A49%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f1d4c0%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua2f7cbcf%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="zU5C8" id="zU5C8" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ufd5e99c6" id="ufd5e99c6">🍀 𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐢𝐧 𝐨𝐟 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub2519812" id="ub2519812"><strong><span data-lake-id="u30511965" id="u30511965" style="color: #DF2A3F">ToT 树搜索过程中生成的非最优思维单元能够提供有价值的偏好信息，从而增强大语言模型的推理能力。本方法的一项主要优势在于，仅在训练阶段利用这种监督信号，从而避免较高的推理延迟。方法包含两个组成部分：合成思维偏好链，即以链式形式组织的思维偏好数据，以及基于 CPO 目标进行训练</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u31d5d951" id="u31d5d951"><span data-lake-id="u5bb0f4af" id="u5bb0f4af">合成和收集思维偏好对的过程紧密遵循 ToT 的推理流程。该流程分为三个部分：思维生成，为每个推理步骤生成多个思维单元；状态评估，对各个思维单元进行评估；搜索与收集，最终确定思维偏好数据</span></p><ul list="uacb3d309"><li fid="u02815446" data-lake-id="ua14ce1a6" id="ua14ce1a6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u34339491" id="u34339491">思维生成：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5fa14ccf" id="u5fa14ccf">给定状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi-1%7D%3D%5Bx%2Cz_1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2Cz_%7Bi-1%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92158f66d86e61f3d96610d240cca358.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hZ29m%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uea28d4af" id="uea28d4af">，该状态由输入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F712ecf7894348e92d8779c3ee87eeeb0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KC8dp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud169563b" id="ud169563b">和截至当前的思维序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5Bz_1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2Cz_%7Bi-1%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8b8f5cc4a59884d3c5d7fbb196fe89a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YJWSh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u84c8b2c8" id="u84c8b2c8">构成，用于表示一个部分解。为下一个推理步骤采样</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lacBN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3b4852da" id="u3b4852da">个思维单元</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6051921d" id="u6051921d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_i%5E%7B(j)%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(z_i%5C%5Cmid%20s_%7Bi-1%7D)%3D%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(z_i%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cz_1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2Cz_%7Bi-1%7D)%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bfor%20%7Dj%3D1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2Ck.%20%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F14741a9d2fa9ad954f6c11a1bcb73013.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ui3qY%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u62bb345b"><li fid="uabc1f2c2" data-lake-id="ud130bcfe" id="ud130bcfe"><strong><span data-lake-id="u481a1f92" id="u481a1f92">状态评估：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9b8883aa" id="u9b8883aa">给定不同状态 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bs_i%5E%7B(j)%7D%5C%5C%7D_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5E%7Bk%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffe6246ce00cc6dc193fa4991a0348835.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zOqxp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u24697201" id="u24697201">，利用大语言模型对这些状态进行推理，并评估其在解决问题方面取得的进展，无需使用外部奖励模型或人工标注</span></li><li fid="uabc1f2c2" data-lake-id="u066b2450" id="u066b2450"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua545b8f2" id="ua545b8f2">搜索与收集：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udcedffff" id="udcedffff">采用带剪枝的广度优先搜索（BFS）来选择推理路径。完成评估后，保留评估分数最高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf378375e7693bdcf9535661c023c02e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HyRTP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u70861587" id="u70861587">个思维单元，并进入下一步生成。当大语言模型生成的思维单元包含 </span><code data-lake-id="uc1b7f8b3" id="uc1b7f8b3"><span data-lake-id="uc4d46744" id="uc4d46744">so the final answer is:</span></code><span data-lake-id="u5e50ff90" id="u5e50ff90"> 时，搜索算法终止并返回选定的路径</span></li><li fid="uabc1f2c2" data-lake-id="u5c47fe01" id="u5c47fe01"><span data-lake-id="u33c6ca8e" id="u33c6ca8e">最终确定推理路径之后，将选定路径中的思维单元标记为优选）思维单元。对于第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fYdNp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uefb15f70" id="uefb15f70">步中的每个优选思维单元</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_i%5Ew%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb5de6e6f4fd4c1acd5a32bd7cd41537d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zf7kw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud6302737" id="ud6302737">，构建与之对应的非优选思维单元。首先确定其父状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi-1%7D%5Ew%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1775ec4eb63d9ce23a23b423d4443b4e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cSXhh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u67c1f03e" id="u67c1f03e">，该状态包含通向</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_i%5Ew%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb5de6e6f4fd4c1acd5a32bd7cd41537d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zlHpt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u23f8d846" id="u23f8d846">的所有先前思维单元。对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi-1%7D%5Ew%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1775ec4eb63d9ce23a23b423d4443b4e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jz1jl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5bcc1cce" id="u5bcc1cce">的每个子思维单元，若其未包含在选定路径中，则将其选作相对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_i%5Ew%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb5de6e6f4fd4c1acd5a32bd7cd41537d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rJ1Ew%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0cbfa6c4" id="u0cbfa6c4">的非优选思维单元</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_i%5El%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e7c54ba87119268a3dce4be069d28b9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hyurt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0892b94e" id="u0892b94e">。通过这一过程，为状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi-1%7D%5Ew%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1775ec4eb63d9ce23a23b423d4443b4e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KnSXk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud5d9250d" id="ud5d9250d">构建偏好对 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(z_i%5Ew%2Cz_i%5El)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc6f2dd273537c387467fa2b2680b7cb4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Z9KEZ%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud495f5bf" id="ud495f5bf" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791003308992-54035e29-9b64-4405-a8ee-4982b4e9394b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u83d66287-367a-4a9f-b523-69c79f2f663%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uaa46dc12-15d5-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A742.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A318%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A235771%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1087%2C%22originHeight%22%3A465%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ISTHATTHOUGHTHELPFULTO%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A204%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ANSWERTHEQUESTION%3F%22%2C%22x%22%3A293%2C%22y%22%3A205%2C%22width%22%3A184%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NEXTSTEP%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A361%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COLLECTED%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A819%2C%22y%22%3A293%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%AD%22%2C%22x%22%3A917%2C%22y%22%3A295%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THOUGHTS%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A170%2C%22y%22%3A404%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%A4%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22x%22%3A686%2C%22y%22%3A252%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THOUGHTS%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A169%2C%22y%22%3A112%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLMSELF%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VALUATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A219%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BFS%2BPRUNING%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GENERATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A39%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%E5%9B%AD%22%2C%22x%22%3A926%2C%22y%22%3A250%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THOUGHT%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A818%2C%22y%22%3A205%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ENERATION%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A388%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DISPREFERRED%22%2C%22x%22%3A810%2C%22y%22%3A185%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PREFERRED%22%2C%22x%22%3A823%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THOUGHTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A818%2C%22y%22%3A270%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%